sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Organization as Organization
    participant EventBus
    Client->>+Organization: register(name)
    Note over Organization: Policies: organizationRead, organizationWrite, organizationExecute
    Note over Organization: Guards (2)
    Organization->>Organization: guard[0]: self.deletedAt == null
    Organization->>Organization: guard[1]: roleAllows(user.role, #quot;adminAccess#quot;)
    Organization->>Organization: mutate.name
    Organization->>EventBus: emit OrganizationRegistered on organization.registered
    Organization-->>-Client: void